# Generated PMTiles data (built by .github/workflows/data-pipeline.yml).
# public 直下・サブディレクトリ（public/tiles/ 等）配下すべての .pmtiles を除外。
# 既存のRange再測定用 public/test-range.pmtiles だけは残す。
public/*.pmtiles
public/**/*.pmtiles
!public/test-range.pmtiles
